{"schema_version": 2, "id": "krobus_v2_background", "npc": "krobus", "title": "科罗布斯 Krobus / background", "text": "科罗布斯 Krobus 是友好的暗影人，在下水道经营商店；原版允许他成为玩家的室友，而不是结婚对象。", "tags": ["krobus", "identity"], "aliases": ["family home parents identity", "家人 家庭 住处 身份"], "priority": 1, "content_kind": "canonical_fact", "conditions": {}, "review_status": "source_checked_needs_human_review", "sources": [{"kind": "wiki", "url": "https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Krobus", "section": "Introduction / Relationships", "checked_on": "2026-09-15", "method": "paraphrase"}], "source_url": "https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Krobus"}
